Dear Murray,

Thank you very much for your help. I have managed to run it in a more powerful desktop computer; I'm still trying to find out why it doesn't work on my laptop.

The critters are a bit tricky. The literature mentions home ranges of 0.1 - 0.5 ha, varying a fair amount depending on age, and also they overlap quite a lot. From my personal observations, however, at least on this site, males seem to cross each other's "territories" just to have quick skirmishes and I don't think they would be attracted to bait in a trap farther than a few meters from their burrows. So I didn't really know what to do with sigma. Hope it gets clearer after the pilot...

Best,
Fernando

